# Claude Code Guidelines

This project is managed and orchestrated by `devctl`.

- Review [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md) for complete architecture topology, active services, port allocations, and devctl lifecycle commands.
- Use `devctl run` to boot services and `devctl add resource` for full-stack CRUD scaffolding.
- Ensure backend DTOs and frontend TypeScript interfaces remain strictly synchronized.
- Execute unit and integration tests before finishing tasks.
